    "body": "One issue that needs to be addressed WRT memory cache is dynamic CSP, see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7686\r\n\r\nIf something is loaded into the memory cache and later a dynamically added CSP directive blocks that type of resource, should it be allowed or not?",
